<title>USA: Aprogenex to appeal delisting decision.</title>
<headline>Aprogenex to appeal delisting decision.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aprogenex Inc Friday said that it is appealing the decision of the American Stock Exchange to delist the company's common stock.</p>
<p>If unsuccessful in its appeal the company will encourage the development of a market for its common stock in the over-the-counter market, it said.</p>
</text>
